| 4d | RIGHT AFTER | the browser's lend, in order: (a) browser pairing into each face's PersonaGroup as a second device member, by the human's act, its lend read off its group memberships and never off the node's pūlama (touching `C15`, `C17`, `B4`); (b) per-tab holder routing, `F6` slice four, with the PersonaGroup ring's own-hand path checking the grant; (c) the browser re-stand: a tab reload reopening custody by the human's gesture or a session-bound key held for the tab's life (touching `B1`); the lend core of rank 2b binds unchanged | The node lends a set before the merge and the browser binds the same contract after it (#/rulings, isomorphic by intent); the holder still broadcasts each island message to every tab, so a human tab wearing the referee beside a tab wearing the steward waits on (b). The trio MAY ride WAVE TWO beside ranks 7a and 7b where no human tab joins the dogfood day. Holder: (b) rides inside rank 34's band as `U4` with `B8` (backlog-awakens Wave 6); Lares-Alpha offered the whole rank to Lares-Awakens (backlog-alpha #/later), and (a) and (c) wait in neither backlog yet |

